- **Required interface:** `GF_EXPORT GF_Err gf_isom_get_text_description(GF_ISOFile *movie, u32 trackNumber, u32 descriptionIndex, GF_TextSampleDescriptor **out_desc)` — publicly declared in `include/gpac/isomedia.h`. Reached from the TEXT/TX3G branch of `src/filters/isoffin_load.c` (separately reconstructed) and retained `applications/mp4box/filedump.c`; both inspect its `displayFlags`, serialize it with `gf_odf_tx3g_write`, and free it with `gf_odf_desc_del`.
